"Ključne besede lahko izberete iz spustnega seznama ali vnesete neposredno v "
"besedilno polje."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/dynamic_text.rst:168
msgid ""
"Timecode keywords are based on the frame rate (fps) and position of the "
"frame. Time-based keywords can include a ``strftime``\\ [#]_ format string "
"to customize the output as long as you put some delimiter except '#' between "
"the keyword and the format string and the keyword comes first. For example, "
"``#localtime %I:%M:%S %p#`` shows only the time in 12-hour format. The '#' "
"may be escaped with '\\''."
msgstr ""
"Ključne besede časovne kode temeljijo na hitrosti sličic (sl/s oz. fps) in "
"položaju sličic. Ključne besede, ki temeljijo na času, lahko vključujejo "
"oblikovni niz ``strftime``\\ [#]_ za prilagoditev izpisa, če med ključno "
"besedo in oblikovnim nizom vstavite ločilo, razen '#' , in če je ključna "
"beseda na prvem mestu. Primer: ``#localtime %I:%M:%S %p#`` prikaže samo čas "
"v 12-urni obliki. Znak ‘#’ lahko zapišemo s predstoječim znakom ‘\\’."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/dynamic_text.rst:171
msgid ""
"This effect uses the clip's properties for the calculation of the keywords' "
"values. For example, **#timecode#** will start counting at the beginning of "
"the clip and not at the position of the clip in the timeline. **#timecode#** "
"will reset at the start of every clip it is assigned to. In order to have "
"**#timecode#** count across the whole length of your project you must assign "
"the effect to the (main) video track or the Master."
msgstr ""
"Ta učinek za izračun vrednosti ključnih besed uporablja lastnosti posnetka. "
"Npr. **#timecode#** bo začel računati na začetku posnetka in ne na položaju "
"posnetka na časovnici. **#timecode#** se ponastavi na začetku vsakega "
"posnetka, ki mu je dodeljen. Če želite, da **#timecode#** šteje po celotni "
"dolžini projekta, ga morate dodeliti (glavni) video stezi."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/dynamic_text.rst:174
msgid ""
":ref:`Render` option in the render dialog to add time code or frame count to "
"the entire rendered project."
msgstr ""
"Možnost :ref:`izriši<Render>` v pogovornem oknu za izris, da dodate časovno "
"kodo ali število sličic celotnemu izrisanemu projektu."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/dynamic_text.rst:177
msgid ""
"In order to use a semi-transparent background color, click on the color "
"panel, click on :guilabel:`+` and use the horizontal slider to change the "
"transparency."
msgstr ""
"Da bi dobili polprosojno barvo ozadja, kliknite ploščo barv, kliknite :"
"guilabel:`+` in uporabite vodoravni drsnik, da spremenite prosojnost."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/dynamic_text.rst:180
msgid ""
"You can add effects to entire video tracks by clicking on the |tools-wizard| "
"icon in the track header and choosing :menuselection:`Menu --> Sequence --> "
"Add Effect`. Video tracks that have effects added to them have the white |"
"tools-wizard|, tracks without have a grey |tools-wizard| icon. See also :ref:"
"`effects-track_effect`."
msgstr ""
"Učinke lahko dodate celotnim video stezam s klikom ikone |tools-wizard| v "
"glavi steze in izberite :menuselection:`Meni --> Zaporedje --> Dodaj "
"učinek`. Video steze, ki imajo dodane učinke, imajo belo ikono |tools-"
"wizard|, steze brez imajo sivo ikono |tools-wizard|. Glejte tudi :ref:"
"`effects-track_effect`."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/dynamic_text.rst:190
msgid "See this list of |possible_formats|."
msgstr "Glejte ta seznam |možnih zapisov<possible_formats>|."

